ted":true,"url":null,"offers":0,"inStock":false,"shop":null},"notes":[{"topic":"Good for","items":[{"id":"Q06418","text":"The colorFabb PA Blue Metal Detectable is a 3D printing filament infused with metal detectable particles.","source":"R-COLORFABB-TDS-E-PA-Blue-Metal-Detectable","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06420","text":"Please be advised that the metal particles integrated into our product are designed for detection by specialized metal detection equipment used in the food industry.","source":"R-COLORFABB-TDS-E-PA-Blue-Metal-Detectable","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06422","text":"Our materials are optimized for advanced metal detection systems like electromagnetic induction and X-ray inspection.","source":"R-COLORFABB-TDS-E-PA-Blue-Metal-Detectable","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Benefits","items":[{"id":"Q06419","text":"The typical blue color and the metal particles, make printed objects readily detectable in various situations.","source":"R-COLORFABB-TDS-E-PA-Blue-Metal-Detectable","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07390","text":"The blue color and metal particles makes this a readily detectable filament.","source":"R-COLORFABB-TDS-E-colorFabbPABlueMetalDetectable","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Pitfalls and limitations","items":[{"id":"Q05301","text":"Disclaimer:Please be advised that the metal particles integrated into our product are designed for detection by specialized metal detection equipment used in the food industry. Standard household magnets or basic metal detectors may not reliably detect these particles. Our materials are optimized for advanced metal detection systems like electromagnetic induction and X-ray inspection. For accurate detection, we recommend using appropriate equipment designed for the food processing environment.","source":"R-COLORFABB-PRINT-20260928-7293b4d77f79","at":"p. 1: exact-product Pitfalls and limitations paragraph; m222 record-tier review","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06421","text":"Standard household magnets or basic metal detectors may not reliably detect these particles.","source":"R-COLORFABB-TDS-E-PA-Blue-Metal-Detectable","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Adhesion between layers","items":[{"id":"Q06425","text":"A fan speed of 0% is advised to achieve the best layer-to-layer adhesion.","source":"R-COLORFABB-TDS-E-PA-Blue-Metal-Detectable","at":"p. 2","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Printing advice","items":[{"id":"Q06423","text":"For accurate detection, we recommend using appropriate equipment designed for the food processing environment and increasing the infill for the 3D printed object to increase the particle content.","source":"R-COLORFABB-TDS-E-PA-Blue-Metal-Detectable","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06424","text":"The fan speed is advised to be altered depending on the desired end finish.","source":"R-COLORFABB-TDS-E-PA-Blue-Metal-Detectable","at":"p. 2","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q06426","text":"In a geometry needs cooling, a maximum of 50% regular fan speed is advised,","source":"R-COLORFABB-TDS-E-PA-Blue-Metal-Detectable","at":"p. 2","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]}]},{"id":"G164-05","name":"UltiMaker MAKERBOT SPECIALTY NYLON","maker":"UltiMaker","variant":null,"diameter":null,"twins":[],"composition":null,"certifications":null,"availability":null,"claim":null,"values":[{"key":"tensileModulusXY","id":"V011167","value":2.2063232,"mark":"apart","why":"not-described","annealed":null,"source":"R-ULTIMAKER-MakerBot-Nylon-092020","page":2,"twin":null,"admitted":["specime